// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Agent Six 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P918943512" "Agent Six"
// ProfessionString :
"P2283904105" "Natural Store"
// DescriptionString :
"P3682172790" "Agent Six works for an secret branch of the US CIA codenamed Omega Watch. Her past is a complete mystery, but rumors of her involvement in world-shaking events like the assassination of dictators always persist. She is exceptionally trained in all forms of Martial Arts and military fighting techniques. She even has a smattering of back street brawling under her belt to complete her skill set. Agent Six will help train natural-based heroes for the right price."
// HelloString :
"P3637300380" "How should we begin today?"
// HelloString :
"P207039607" "Let's begin."
// HelloString :
"P3833101930" "Lemme see your stance."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3027455000" "I can not be of any assistance to you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2546518765" "Omega Watch said you would be by eventually. If you need some training in Natural fighting techniques, I am your woman, but I need you to prove you're up to the job at hand first."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P113872852" "Thanks for helping out Omega Watch with that situation"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1317581692" "I have something, but it's classified beyond your current Security Level."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1762696384" "You've proven yourself, but just barely. I was sent here to improve your skills, and from what I have seen you need a lot of improvement. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Are you ready to start?</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1715550569" "I've taught you all I can, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P2910166953" "Founder's Falls"
// IntroString :
"P2703563184" "IntroString"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1677896178" "IntroAcceptString"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1634259363" "IntroSendoffString"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1326076718" "IntroduceOneContact"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3343443605" "IntroduceTwoContacts"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


