// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Colonel_Barry_Woodhouse 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Colonel Barry Woodhouse 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1856967987" "Colonel Barry Woodhouse"
// ProfessionString :
"P310556016" "Intelligence Officer"
// DescriptionString :
"P240500472" "Colonel Barry Woodhouse works for military intelligence, gathering data on all Rikti activities within the Crash Site. His major concern is the safety of his junior officers, and supply lines in the Crash Site aren't always easy to maintain. For this reason, Colonel Woodhouse purchases excess Enhancements from heroes in the zone, with his discretionary budget, or even out of his own pocket. He tries to keep his activities from his superiors, who wouldn't approve of such unorthodox supply routes. "
// HelloString :
"P3915386365" "Do you have any gear for me, soldier?"
// HelloString :
"P1358829231" "Anything you can give me, I can use."
// HelloString :
"P2703329208" "We're running dry on everything around here. Anything you can do to pitch in?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P845752784" "I've got to keep my men's equipment in top form, and sometimes that means bending the rules and buying gear from civilians. I don't apologize for what I do; my men's safety is my top priority, and that's just the way it should be."
// LocationString :
"P2003638935" "Rikti Crash Site"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


