// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Scott Wachhorst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P819886757" "Dr. Scott Wachhorst"
// ProfessionString :
"P3460571030" "Xenobiologist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1409744311" "Dr. Scott Wachhorst made a name for himself in xenobiology by the time he was twenty, with his excellent theoretical articles on extraterrestrial life. Still, there's only so much you can write about aliens while you're stuck on one planet. Dr. Wachhorst considers the Shadow Shard to be the ultimate opportunity to further his understanding of life forms from other worlds, though he's beginning to suspect that the this world and our own have more in common than appearances suggest. He's eager to study all aspects of the Shadow Shard, and will happily pay heroes for any materials they have picked up during their travels."
// HelloString :
"P148401840" "Hello, hello! What have you brought me?"
// HelloString :
"P1485951814" "I hope you've found something interesting."
// HelloString :
"P720881364" "Got something for me?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3062206207" "I'm glad to meet you, {HeroName}. The name's Wachhorst. Dr. Wachhorst. If you're overburdened with souvenirs from the Shadow Shard, I'd be more than happy to ease your burden."
// LocationString :
"P2754547058" "Firebase Zulu"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


