// Name :
"P3573635087" "Ghost Falcon"
// ProfessionString :
"P1997879687" "Dimensional Refugee"
// DescriptionString :
"P590299872" "Ghost Falcon hails from an alternate dimension, one where people and things are dramatically different than they are in this world. At one point in his past he attacked the Crey facilities of that world, and was captured. Crey scientists there severed the mental link he had to the rest of his team and deprogrammed him as part of their 'Project: Redemption'. Ghost Falcon has come to this world after a portal was recently opened between the two universes. His motives here are still unknown."
// HelloString :
"P3582981583" "It's a pleasure to see you again."
// HelloString :
"P421539819" "I hope everything is well."
// HelloString :
"P3300143352" "Evil's tendrils reach farther than you can know."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3640925354" "I shouldn't be speaking with you, it's too dangerous for someone like you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3042043976" "A genuine Hero! It's a pleasure to meet you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P27903246" "You have done me a great service. Now I would like to repay the favor."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P171733042" "Finish what you are working on, I have a job that needs your special touch."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P889135457" "Well done, my friend."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2897885276" "You have surpassed the point at which I can assist you. Good luck."
// LocationString :
"P534126238" "Perigrine Island"
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
