// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Holsten_Armitage 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Holsten Armitage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1237477603" "Holsten Armitage"
// ProfessionString :
"P157228807" "Science Store"
// DescriptionString :
"P48194965" "Holsten Armitage is one of two things: brilliant or insane. He claims he is from Paragon City, 20 years in the future. A future he says where the Rikti have invaded Earth and destroyed all of mankind. He was working on a time-travel device when the final attack happened, and gathered what he could and sent himself back to present day Paragon City, where he could warn the Heroes of the impending doom, and use his scientific knowledge from the future to better outfit them against the threat. Whether he is telling the truth or delusional, one thing is certain, his experiments have enabled science-based heroes to greatly improve their powers and abilities."
// HelloString :
"P693582613" "If my calculations are correct... Oh, hello!"
// HelloString :
"P1531642623" "Pi over the constant of T... Ah, did you need something?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P41687499" "Why won't you believe me! No one believes me! Bah!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3613476282" "You, you believe me, right? I swear, I am from the future! I built a time machine and escaped the Rikti genocide of humanity. I am here to help! I have all sorts of Science experiments I brought back that can really shake things up around here. But you... you don't believe me do you?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2048140439" "You can sure handle those Rikti. Working together I am sure we can beat them this time."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1037583146" "That never happened in my time-stream. Looks like we are changing the future already! <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Now what did you want to go over first?</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2928914921" "By my calculations, we have successfully altered the time-stream. Now, I just need to figure out a way to get back to my own timeframe... Excuse me."
// LocationString :
"P1230199062" "Brickstown"
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


