"P3248642081" "Serge (Icon Tailor)"
// ProfessionString :
"P2759008275" "Tailor"
// DescriptionString :
"P455781317" "Serge has been doing costume designs for Heroes in the Los Angeles area for almost a decade. When Icon opened up their doors in Paragon City, Serge made sure he was at the top of the list for transfers."
// HelloString :
"P4170369900" "Hello, my name is Serge, how can I help you?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1657278088" "Idontknowyoustring"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4056618105" "Welcome to Icon! We have everything you need to change your outdated look! Now, before we begin, you'll need to be at least Security Level 20. And I do have a tiny favor to ask of you first."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3332020585" "Icon is pleased to be the ones who can adjust your style."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3568790862" "I think you need to establish your look a bit more before Icon can help you. Speak to me again when you are more well know, perhaps around security level 20."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P781999391" "You seem like a hero ready to make a change of outfit, and I am the one who can help you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3257817312" "I've done all that I can for you, and I think that you are looking fabulous. I would suggest you try our store in Independence Port if you want to refresh your look."
// LocationString :
"P3493519327" "Steel Canyon"
