// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1049283673" "Carson handles only the biggest celebrity Heroes. He makes sure that they are always outfitted in the latest of fashions and that they remember to treat the general public with the respect they deserve."
// HelloString :
"P1059670092" "Looks like the fashion crisis is beginning again."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P180007002" "Oh my... You need some serious help... That... that just isn't even the style anymore... I'd love to help you out too, but I need you to do me a favor first, and I'm afraid you'll have to be at least Security Level 40 to do it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1681700067" "I'm sorry, but we only deal with the very top tier of the hero community. I'm sure you'll get there, eventually, so why don't you come back when you're, say, security level 40 to 50? Thanks."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4242262189" "Now let's get to work on that outfit of yours."
