"P3421243081" "Kallarn"
// ProfessionString :
"P69439912" "Renegade Brute"
// DescriptionString :
"P1065397205" "Kallarn's got one major problem in life: he's smarter than the average Brute. Kallarn's unusual intelligence led him to question Ruladak's oppressive rule over the Brutes. When Kallarn's disloyal thoughts were discovered, Ruladak ordered the other Brutes to dispose of him. Kallarn barely escaped the clutches of his former companions, and now he is plotting his revenge. He is busily collecting all items of power, in the hopes that he will one day be strong enough to overthrow Ruladak."
// HelloString :
"P3941089838" "You. Give. Items."
// HelloString :
"P2884736906" "Must. Gain. Power!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1040920841" "You have power? You give to Kallarn. I grow strong. I tumble Ruladak from throne!"
// LocationString :
"P2414137229" "Cascades"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


