"P2413007608" "Mark IV"
// ProfessionString :
"P2797167698" "Tech Store"
// DescriptionString :
"P2650785718" "Mark IV is one of Crey's creations, a cybernetic organism that they gave a little too much independent thinking to. Mark IV realized the true nature of Crey Industries, and engineered his escape from one of their high-security labs. Mark IV realized that he can not fight Crey alone, so he has enlisted the help of technological heroes to help him. He uses his vast knowledge of cybernetics to make sure that his allies in the fight against Crey are outfitted with the latest and best cybernetics available. He fears the day when Crey finally tracks him down and dismantles him, and hopes it never comes to pass."
// HelloString :
"P356766018" "Greetings"
// HelloString :
"P1036676876" "I have procured more equipment for you"
// HelloString :
"P360520946" "I believe you will like my latest acquisitions"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P571855450" "Identity: Unknown. I can not trust you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P898655499" "Identity: {HeroName}. Confirmed. I need your help. If you can help me I can give you access to many pieces of Technology."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3694113295" "You have helped me, and now I will help you."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4198918906" "Thank you for dealing with Crey. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>I believe I can greatly assist you.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
