// Name :
"P2249078441" "The Nameless Mystic"
// ProfessionString :
"P2951540447" "Interdimensional Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P2973913846" "No one knows where this man came from, his goals, or even his name. All that's known is that, somehow, he is absorbing the energy given off by the dreaded Lanaru. He desperately craves all items of power, which he seems to consume by the cartload. What he does with this power remains a mystery."
// HelloString :
"P2090944018" "You have power for me?"
// HelloString :
"P2922886290" "I must have more power!"
// HelloString :
"P921088002" "I need power. Please, can you help?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P655033372" "My friend, I need power. All that you can bring. All that the Shadow Shard encompasses. I truly hope you can help me. Otherwise, all may be lost."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


