"P490599854" "Serafina"
// ProfessionString :
"P3463465171" "Magic Store"
// DescriptionString :
"P4156627115" "Serafina is a former Genie, who was once owned by one of the heroes to take up the mantle of Scirocco. Scirocco and Serafina had a very amicable relationship; she would help with his crime fighting career from behind the scenes, using her magical powers. Scirocco was one of the first heroes slain in the Rikti War, and with his dying breath made one last wish of Serafina, to help the heros of Paragon City. Serafina did not know that by granting this wish she would lose most of her genie powers, leaving her with only her communcation lines to the Entities. She uses these lines to embolden Magic based heroes of Paragon City, fulfilling Scirocco's final wish."
// HelloString :
"P1386620661" "Greetings, my friend."
// HelloString :
"P279754992" "The Entities smile upon you."
// HelloString :
"P2144775614" "What is your wish?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2398337545" "They tell me that I am not the one to assist you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3438797150" "They tell me that I am to help you. I can give magic Heroes a direct line to the Entities, but I would be curious if you could perform one small personal favor for me first."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1421049198" "A line to the Entities has been established."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2156176220" "The Entities see greatness in you, as do I. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>What would you like to call upon them for?</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3727701459" "You have surpassed the power of which I can help you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
