"P3404674423" "Slarrah has come a long way since his first days in the Shadow Shard, roaming its islands and tormenting its denizens. After a chance encounter with Faathim the Kind, Slarrah's whole viewpoint was changed. He now seeks to bring peace to the Shadow Shard, by accumulating any items of powers adventurers are willing to part with. If the tools of war are eventually brought to ruin, Slarrah reasons, there must eventually be peace."
